      "value": "@{5e901d7b8789b227c453bf3c|full_name}: yeh Ive seen posts across this feedback website, under steam discussion and on reddit and I've come across a few people having the exact same issues. This game is now completly unplayable for me, because well.. I cant chat, in vr chat :/.. One person has had success by changing their computer network to private and white listing vrc in their firewall. I wouldnt even say my mic is half what it was, its more 10% and people can only hear me speak when their in my personal space. Cannot even go to worlds such as pug/cat etc because I cant compete with everyone else speaking.",
